<title>POLAND: PLI tumbles on July net loss.</title>
<headline>PLI tumbles on July net loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesaler and retailer PLI SA tumbled 9.6 percent on Tuesday to 8.95 zlotys on Monday's news the firm had made a 0.8-milion-zloty net loss in July, traders said.</p>
<p>The main market's other big losers on Tuesday, Prochnik and Tonsil, also saw losses in July. The two firms fell 9.1 percent and 7.8 percent respectively in light trade.</p>
